#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:4
msgid "v3.9.4"
msgstr "v3.9.4"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.9.4 adds a ``buzzer`` module, Himax **HM01B0 motion detection** ioctls "
"(with low-power wake-on-motion examples), MT9V034 readout-window control, "
"Ethernet low-power functions, an OV7670 camera driver, and the **Arduino "
"Nano 33 BLE Sense** camera. It also lands a large batch of JPEG / LCD / TV "
"speedups. The VSYNC output API was replaced with a callback and the MT9V034 "
"gain/exposure math was corrected — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.4 voegt een ``buzzer``\\ -module toe, Himax "
"**HM01B0-bewegingsdetectie**\\ -ioctls (met voorbeelden voor stroombesparend"
" wake-on-motion), MT9V034-uitleesvenstercontrole, Ethernet-"
"stroombesparingsfuncties, een OV7670-cameradriver en de **Arduino Nano 33 "
"BLE Sense**\\ -camera. Het levert ook een grote reeks JPEG-/LCD-/TV-"
"versnellingen. De VSYNC-uitvoer-API is vervangen door een callback en de "
"MT9V034 versterkings-/belichtingsberekening is gecorrigeerd — lees de "
"ingrijpende wijzigingen hieronder."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:16
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Op deze pagina"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Hoogtepunten"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Buzzer module** — a new ``buzzer`` module (``freq()``, ``duty()``, "
"``RESONANT_FREQ``) on the OpenMV Pure Thermal."
msgstr ""
"**Buzzer-module** — een nieuwe ``buzzer``\\ -module (\\ ``freq()``\\ , "
"``duty()``\\ , ``RESONANT_FREQ``\\ ) op de OpenMV Pure Thermal."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:23
msgid ""
"**HM01B0 motion detection** — new Himax motion-detection ioctls plus a low-"
"power wake-on-motion example."
msgstr ""
"**HM01B0-bewegingsdetectie** — nieuwe Himax-bewegingsdetectie-ioctls plus "
"een stroombesparend wake-on-motion-voorbeeld."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:25
msgid ""
"**MT9V034 readout window** — control the global-shutter readout window via "
":func:`sensor.ioctl`."
msgstr ""
"**MT9V034-uitleesvenster** — beheer het global-shutter-uitleesvenster via "
":func:`sensor.ioctl`\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:27
msgid ""
"**New cameras / boards** — basic OV7670 driver, Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense "
"camera, and the Bormio board."
msgstr ""
"**Nieuwe camera's / boards** — basis-OV7670-driver, Arduino Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense-camera en het Bormio-board."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Faster pipeline** — rewritten SIMD JPEG encoder, faster debayering, and "
"big LCD/TV transfer speedups."
msgstr ""
"**Snellere pipeline** — herschreven SIMD JPEG-encoder, snellere debayering "
"en grote LCD-/TV-overdrachtsversnellingen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** ``sensor.set_vsync_output()`` was replaced with "
":func:`sensor.set_vsync_callback` and the MT9V034 gain/exposure math was "
"corrected — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Ingrijpend:** ``sensor.set_vsync_output()`` is vervangen door "
":func:`sensor.set_vsync_callback` en de MT9V034 "
"versterkings-/belichtingsberekening is gecorrigeerd — zie de ingrijpende "
"wijzigingen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:36
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nieuwe functies"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Buzzer** — added a ``buzzer`` module with ``buzzer.freq()``, "
"``buzzer.duty()``, and a ``buzzer.RESONANT_FREQ`` constant (OpenMV Pure "
"Thermal)."
msgstr ""
"**Buzzer** — een ``buzzer``\\ -module toegevoegd met ``buzzer.freq()``\\ , "
"``buzzer.duty()`` en een ``buzzer.RESONANT_FREQ``\\ -constante (OpenMV Pure "
"Thermal)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:41
msgid ""
"**HM01B0 motion detection** — added the ``IOCTL_HIMAX_MD_ENABLE`` / "
"``MD_WINDOW`` / ``MD_THRESHOLD`` / ``MD_CLEAR`` and "
"``IOCTL_HIMAX_OSC_ENABLE`` ioctls, with a Himax motion-detection example and"
" a ``himax_wakeup_on_motion_detection.py`` low-power wake example."
msgstr ""
"**HM01B0-bewegingsdetectie** — de ioctls ``IOCTL_HIMAX_MD_ENABLE`` / "
"``MD_WINDOW`` / ``MD_THRESHOLD`` / ``MD_CLEAR`` en "
"``IOCTL_HIMAX_OSC_ENABLE`` toegevoegd, met een Himax-"
"bewegingsdetectievoorbeeld en een stroombesparend wake-voorbeeld "
"``himax_wakeup_on_motion_detection.py``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:45
msgid ""
"**MT9V034 readout window** — added ``IOCTL_SET_READOUT_WINDOW`` / "
"``IOCTL_GET_READOUT_WINDOW`` for MT9V034 readout-window control via "
":func:`sensor.ioctl`."
msgstr ""
"**MT9V034-uitleesvenster** — ``IOCTL_SET_READOUT_WINDOW`` / "
"``IOCTL_GET_READOUT_WINDOW`` toegevoegd voor MT9V034-uitleesvenstercontrole "
"via :func:`sensor.ioctl`\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Ethernet low power** — added Ethernet power-down / low-power functions."
msgstr ""
"**Ethernet-stroombesparing** — Ethernet power-down-/stroombesparingsfuncties"
" toegevoegd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Portenta** — added enable/disable external-oscillator callback functions."
msgstr ""
"**Portenta** — callbackfuncties toegevoegd om de externe oscillator in/uit "
"te schakelen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:52
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Overige wijzigingen en verbeteringen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:54
msgid ""
"Rewrote the JPEG encoder with SIMD and sped up Bayer→YCbCr encoding, kept "
"the hardware JPEG core powered during script execution, sped up debayering "
"(~19.5 ms for VGA), offloaded JPEG compression to MDMA, accelerated the "
"TV/LCD transfer paths with SIMD/efficient DMA, and massively reduced SPI LCD"
" bus usage. Added a USB3320 ULPI PHY driver for high-speed USB."
msgstr ""
"De JPEG-encoder herschreven met SIMD en de Bayer→YCbCr-encodering versneld, "
"de hardware-JPEG-kern ingeschakeld gehouden tijdens scriptuitvoering, "
"debayering versneld (~19,5 ms voor VGA), JPEG-compressie verplaatst naar "
"MDMA, de TV-/LCD-overdrachtspaden versneld met SIMD/efficiënte DMA en het "
"SPI LCD-busgebruik enorm verminderd. Een USB3320 ULPI PHY-driver toegevoegd "
"voor high-speed USB."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:61
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Bugfixes"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:63
msgid "Camera and sensors:"
msgstr "Camera en sensoren:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:65
msgid ""
"Fixed the HM01B0 driver init/streaming and tuned its AE target / max gain, "
"corrected MT9V034 AGC/AEC gain clamping, and fixed OV5640 autofocus firmware"
" loading (byte order)."
msgstr ""
"De HM01B0-driver-init/-streaming gerepareerd en het AE-doel / de maximale "
"versterking afgesteld, de MT9V034 AGC/AEC-versterkingsbegrenzing "
"gecorrigeerd en het laden van de OV5640-autofocusfirmware (byte-volgorde) "
"gerepareerd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:69
msgid "Display:"
msgstr "Display:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:71
msgid ""
"Fixed SPI LCD DMA transfers larger than 64 KB, LCD output polarity, and LCD "
"bus stability (AXI QOS)."
msgstr ""
"SPI LCD DMA-overdrachten groter dan 64 KB, de LCD-uitvoerpolariteit en de "
"LCD-busstabiliteit (AXI QOS) gerepareerd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:74
msgid "System and connectivity:"
msgstr "Systeem en connectiviteit:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:76
msgid ""
"Fixed the SDMMC instance used by the CYW43 WiFi driver (with a board-defined"
" SDMMC instance), improved FLIR Lepton DMA efficiency (VOSPI raised to 20 "
"MHz on H7), fixed Portenta low-power / standby behavior (PMIC SW1 current "
"limit, Ethernet and ULPI low-power), made the RTSP server tolerate out-of-"
"order ``CSeq`` and ``PLAY Range`` headers (FFPLAY), fixed linker stack "
"8-byte EABI alignment, and fixed a broken import in the Portenta "
"``mqtt_sub.py`` example."
msgstr ""
"De door de CYW43 WiFi-driver gebruikte SDMMC-instance gerepareerd (met een "
"board-gedefinieerde SDMMC-instance), de FLIR Lepton DMA-efficiëntie "
"verbeterd (VOSPI verhoogd naar 20 MHz op H7), het Portenta "
"stroombesparings-/standby-gedrag gerepareerd (PMIC SW1-stroomlimiet, "
"Ethernet- en ULPI-stroombesparing), de RTSP-server bestand gemaakt tegen "
"out-of-order ``CSeq``\\ - en ``PLAY Range``\\ -headers (FFPLAY), de 8-byte "
"EABI-uitlijning van de linker-stack gerepareerd en een kapotte import in het"
" Portenta-voorbeeld ``mqtt_sub.py`` gerepareerd."

